# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Survey pagkatapos ng kurso {#post-course-survey}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Congratulations on completing this course! Please take a moment to help us improve our course by filling out the following [quick survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_cGuII9nhoHNaelU). Your feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. Thank you!\n"
msgstr "Binabati ka sa pagkumpleto ng kursong ito! Mangyaring maglaan ng saglit upang tulungan kaming mapabuti ang aming kurso sa pamamagitan ng pagsagot sa sumusunod na [maikling survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_cGuII9nhoHNaelU). Ang iyong feedback ay gagamitin upang pahusayin ang aming content offering at user experience. Salamat!\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Subukan ang iyong kaalaman {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button below to navigate to IBM&reg; Training, where you can take the badging exam for Variational algorithm design.\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos makumpleto ang mga pagbabasa at aktibidad sa kursong ito, i-click ang button sa ibaba para pumunta sa IBM&reg; Training, kung saan maaari mong kunin ang badging exam para sa Variational algorithm design.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be sent to the email you used to register with IBM&reg; Training.\n"
msgstr "Ang pagsusulit ay binubuo ng 20 tanong, at kailangan mong sagutin nang tama ang hindi bababa sa 16 para makapasa. Sa pagtanggap ng passing score, awtomatikong ipapadala ang iyong badge sa email na ginamit mo sa pag-register sa IBM&reg; Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr "Tiyaking handa ka na bago kumuha ng pagsusulit. Kung hindi ka makakakuha ng passing score sa dalawang pagtatangka, pansamantalang mala-lock ang pagsusulit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr "Paalala: Ang mga pagsusulit na ito sa IBM Training site ay maaaring pansamantalang hindi available sa susunod na ilang araw, dahil sa maintenance.\n"

